{{!
    Airpay Deadline Tile — Phase B0 iter 5 (2026-05-14)

    Canonical row for an "approaching deadline" list. Used in:
      - Dashboard "Upcoming Deadlines" section (learner + manager)
      - Manager team-compliance view (per-report overdue list)
      - Notification email cadence engine (template inclusion)

    Four urgency states map to semantic tokens:
      urgency = "overdue"  past due, red bg, danger icon
                "urgent"   < 24h to deadline, red bg, exclamation icon
                "soon"     < 7d to deadline, amber bg, clock icon
                "normal"   >= 7d, neutral bg, calendar icon (default)

    Context:
        coursename  (required) — escaped course title
        duedate     (required) — pre-formatted due date string
        urgency     (optional) — "overdue" | "urgent" | "soon" | "normal"
        icon        (optional) — FA icon name. Data layer should set the
                                 right icon for the urgency; partial
                                 defaults to "calendar" if missing.
        viewurl     (optional) — link to course. Renders the View button.
        relative    (optional) — human relative string ("Due tomorrow")
                                 shown instead of duedate when present.

    A11y:
      - Wrap in <ul class="airpay-deadline-list"> upstream.
      - Icon is aria-hidden — urgency is conveyed by text.
      - View link gets an aria-label combining course + due time.

    Usage:
        {{> theme_airpayux/components/deadline_tile }}
}}
<li class="airpay-deadline airpay-deadline--{{#urgency}}{{urgency}}{{/urgency}}{{^urgency}}normal{{/urgency}}">
    <div class="airpay-deadline__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <i class="fa fa-{{#icon}}{{icon}}{{/icon}}{{^icon}}calendar{{/icon}}"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="airpay-deadline__body">
        <span class="airpay-deadline__name">{{coursename}}</span>
        <span class="airpay-deadline__date">
            {{#relative}}{{relative}}{{/relative}}{{^relative}}Due: {{duedate}}{{/relative}}
        </span>
    </div>
    {{#viewurl}}
    <a href="{{viewurl}}"
       class="airpay-deadline__action airpay-btn airpay-btn--outline airpay-btn--sm"
       aria-label="View {{coursename}}, due {{#relative}}{{relative}}{{/relative}}{{^relative}}{{duedate}}{{/relative}}">
        {{# str }}view, core{{/ str }}
    </a>
    {{/viewurl}}
</li>
